+
+## Bulk import
+
+`importTasks(list, text)` adds tasks from text with one task per line, as `title;priority;tags`, for
+example `Renew the insurance;high;admin money`. The priority may be empty for a normal one; tags are
+separated by spaces; blank lines are skipped. It returns `{ imported, rejected }`, where `rejected` lists
+each line that could not be added as `{ line, reason }`, with `line` counting from 1 (blank lines included).
